# File Operations

## Moving Files

- If the agent is going to move a file, check whether it is under version control.
- If the file is under version control, the agent should use `git mv` instead of creating a new file and deleting the old one.
- This preserves the file history in git and is the correct way to move tracked files.
- Example: Use `git mv tests/test_black.py tests/unit/tools/test_black.py` instead of creating the new file and deleting the old one.
